  "description": "Not sure what bike you need? The Aeris 120 is our do it all mountain bike that you can take anywhere. It’s a bike that never feels like overkill on your local trails, but isn’t afraid of the black runs either. Trails centre loops, uplift days, long cross country rides and enduro racing – the Aeris 120 is a true one bike to rule them all.\nThe Aeris 120 features:\n\n120mm rear travel, 130mm or 140mm suspension fork.\n27.5″ wheels\n148 Boost rear end\nMetric shock sizing\n1x specific rear end for maximum stiffness and tyre clearance (up to 2.6″)\nRemovable ISG05 mount\nBottle cage mounts\nFantastic pedalling performance combined with a supportive shock curve\nExternal cable routing for ease of maintenance\nThreaded Bottom bracket\n5 sizes, 3 colours and complete configuration control on all models\n\nShop Aeris 120 Now\n\nGeometry",
